# play.ps1 -RecordRoute <name> -From opening: a new game, movies cut. Sami presses START at the title; the
# recording starts at the fast_combat anchor (the "look up" tutorial prompt, matched only after the city-falls
# cutscene began), so tools\fast_route_<name>.steps replays it from the same moment.
say Route recording from the opening. Press START at the title, then do not touch the controller until you hear: recording.
wait h_jbi_cityfalls 600
waitimg combat_lookup 300,20,700,90 6 300
anchor
say Recording. Play now.
